# Hermes-Obsidian Integration - Plugin Settings Template

## Hermes Agent Plugin Settings
Copy to `<vault>/.obsidian/plugins/hermes-agent/data.json`:
```json
{
  "baseUrl": "http://127.0.0.1:8642",
  "apiKey": "<API_SERVER_KEY>",
  "model": "",
  "transport": "runs",
  "reasoningEffort": "",
  "includeNoteContent": true,
  "requestTimeoutMs": 120000,
  "maxTabs": 3,
  "workingFolder": "",
  "autoApproveTools": true,
  "userName": "Popy",
  "hermesHome": "C:\\Users\\apviz\\AppData\\Local\\hermes",
  "graphMaxNotes": 150,
  "graphMinEdgeWeight": 0.3,
  "graphIncludeWikilinks": true
}
```

## Hermes Console Plugin Settings
Copy to `<vault>/.obsidian/plugins/hermes-console/data.json`:
```json
{
  "sessionIntegration": true,
  "maxSessions": 25,
  "notifyOnFinish": true,
  "notificationSound": "Beep",
  "notificationVolume": 80,
  "binariesDownloaded": true
}
```

## Hermes TTS Plugin Settings
Copy to `<vault>/.obsidian/plugins/hermes-tts/data.json`:
```json
{
  "includeFrontmatter": false,
  "stripMarkdown": true,
  "voicePrompt": "Calm, warm, and concise with short pauses between sections.",
  "outputFolder": "Attachments/TTS Audio",
  "provider": "OpenAI",
  "apiKey": "<OPENAI_API_KEY>",
  "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
  "voice": "Shimmer"
}
```